  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 703.06 Use of Delineated Prime Wetlands Boundaries",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 703.06 Use of Delineated Prime Wetlands Boundaries. The application for a project in a prime wetlands or a duly-established 100-foot buffer for which boundaries have been designated under this chapter shall show the boundaries:\n\n(a) As submitted to and accepted by the department pursuant to Env-Wt 703.04, if no revisions have been made; or\n\n(b) As revised pursuant to Env-Wt 703.07.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 700) #12807, eff 12-15-19; ss by #13946, eff 4-27-24",
